Package: sandboxcore-host
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Raub Camaioni <raubcameo@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: podman (>= 4.4), uidmap, fuse-overlayfs, passt | slirp4netns, systemd, passwd, python3 (>= 3.10)
Homepage: https://github.com/RaubCamaioni/sandboxcore
Description: host setup for running untrusted code in rootless podman
 Prepares a Debian or Ubuntu host for sandboxcore: rootless podman and its
 helpers, cgroup delegation (cpu cpuset io memory pids) to every user's
 systemd manager so container limits are enforced, sandboxcore-adduser to
 create an unprivileged user with a sub-uid range and lingering, and
 sandboxcore-doctor to check the result.
